{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_029400","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这里也和Bosque del Alba一样，是高温多湿的热带雨林。El Cenegal意为“泥”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"AUX_MUD_MEANING_AND_CLIMATE_DRIFT_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"泥吗。得小心别陷住脚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"JPN_STUCK_FEET_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这一带的河流经常泛滥。洪水溢出时会冲刷地表，到处都留下这样的沟槽。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"AUX_FLOOD_CAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"看起来很适合隐蔽前进。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"JPN_MOVEMENT_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这也意味着我们这边的视野会很差。小心，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""}]}